  "description": "Solution Dev Pack to read, create, update, and delete DataMiner SLA data. Provides strongly typed models and validated repositories for SLAs and SLA templates, stored as DOM instances in the \"slamanager\" module. This is the core package shared by the .Automation, .GQI, and .Protocol packages, which add the entry point for each script type.\n[Minimum Required DataMiner: 10.5.9]\nCode Entry Point: var slaManager = connection.GetSlaManagerHelper();\nRefer to the readme for more information.",
